here $n$ ranges from $n=1$ to $n=11.$ Indeed: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =8(1)=8 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =8(2)=16 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =8(3)=24 \\\\  & \\,\\,⋮ \\\\ {a}_{10} & =8(10)=80 \\\\ {a}_{11} & =8(11)=88\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}S=8+16+24+⋯+80+88={\\sum }_{n=1}^{11}8n.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-dd5db24a-0334-5fd9-a195-a6f3785eda3b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-944f2e05-631f-5917-979a-ad00e83fe8a8" :answer-field/id #uuid "944f2e05-631f-5917-979a-ad00e83fe8a8"] ["answer-add3a4ae-8c07-5039-ba04-4c97679fbc0f" :answer/id #uuid "add3a4ae-8c07-5039-ba04-4c97679fbc0f"] ["answer-add3a4ae-8c07-5039-ba04-4c97679fbc0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-add3a4ae-8c07-5039-ba04-4c97679fbc0f" :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{10}8n"] ["answer-323b99ba-09f2-5bc7-9d64-8e7dd6ab6344" :answer/id #uuid "323b99ba-09f2-5bc7-9d64-8e7dd6ab6344"] ["answer-323b99ba-09f2-5bc7-9d64-8e7dd6ab6344" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-323b99ba-09f2-5bc7-9d64-8e7dd6ab6344" :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{11}(8n+8)"] ["answer-6ee3a55d-76a5-5964-95de-fa24a41c09c8" :answer/id #uuid "6ee3a55d-76a5-5964-95de-fa24a41c09c8"] ["answer-6ee3a55d-76a5-5964-95de-fa24a41c09c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6ee3a55d-76a5-5964-95de-fa24a41c09c8" :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{11}(8n-8)"] ["answer-4941d029-0c96-5c12-a446-5688c75f9081" :answer/id #uuid "4941d029-0c96-5c12-a446-5688c75f9081"] ["answer-4941d029-0c96-5c12-a446-5688c75f9081" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4941d029-0c96-5c12-a446-5688c75f9081" :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{11}(n+8)"] ["answer-448738d9-f7ba-5faa-973c-18695727c554" :answer/id #uuid "448738d9-f7ba-5faa-973c-18695727c554"] ["answer-448738d9-f7ba-5faa-973c-18695727c554" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-448738d9-f7ba-5faa-973c-18695727c554" :answer/value "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{11}8n"] ["answer-field-944f2e05-631f-5917-979a-ad00e83fe8a8" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-944f2e05-631